flowchart TD
  A[New codex session] --> B[Read AGENTS + state]
  B --> C[Inspect git + current phase]
  C --> D[Load relevant Skill]
  D --> E[Read specs + official docs if version-sensitive]
  E --> F[Plan coherent change]
  F --> G[Implement + tests]
  G --> H[Focused verification]
  H --> I[Independent reviewer subagent]
  I --> J{High/Critical findings?}
  J -- yes --> G
  J -- no --> K[scripts/verify.py]
  K --> L[Update roadmap/state/ADR]
  L --> M[Next ready phase]
